## 3. TREE HIERARCHY & PARENT-CHILD GRAPH
```
[chest] (ROOT)
 ├── [head]
 │    ├── [muzzle]
 │    ├── [jaw]
 │    ├── [cheekL]
 │    └── [cheekR]
 ├── [rear]
 │    ├── [pelvis]
 │    ├── [BL0] ──> [BL1] ──> [BL2] ──> [BL3] ──> [BL4]
 │    └── [BR0] ──> [BR1] ──> [BR2] ──> [BR3] ──> [BR4]
 ├── [FL1] ──> [FL2] ──> [FL3] ──> [FL4]
 └── [FR1] ──> [FR2] ──> [FR3] ──> [FR4]
```

---

## 4. DYNAMIC SCRUTINY VALIDATION (tools/rig_math_gate.py)
The Pre-Flight Scrutiny Gate reads `node_map.json` to dynamically validate any incoming model or mod:
1. **Tree Connectivity:** Confirms no orphan nodes or disconnected branches.
2. **Socket Resolution:** Confirms every story socket points to a valid physical node.
3. **Symmetry Matching:** Automatically verifies mirrored pairs without hardcoding.
